fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"video/videoconverter.html#gst_video_converter_transform_metas","fragment":"\n\tgst_video_converter_transform_metas\n\n\n\tGstVideo.VideoConverter.prototype.transform_metas\n\n\n\tGstVideo.VideoConverter.transform_metas\n\nTransform the GstMeta of src into dest using convert.\nParameters:\na GstVideoConverter\na GstBuffer\na writable GstBuffer\nTRUE if any meta was copied\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nTransform the GstMeta of src into dest using convert.\nParameters:\na GstVideo.VideoConverter\na Gst.Buffer\na writable Gst.Buffer\nTRUE if any meta was copied\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nTransform the GstMeta of src into dest using convert.\nParameters:\na GstVideo.VideoConverter\na Gst.Buffer\na writable Gst.Buffer\nTRUE if any meta was copied\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});